  storyText: {fileID: 1837923567}
  continuePrompt: {fileID: 877739266}
  segments:
  - Cold dirt presses against your back. Far below, a blue pulse beats like a second
    heart.
  - "A faint melody coils up the pit \u2014 not words, just notes, soft and trembling,
    brushing your ribs like a tide."
  - The darkness shifts; tiny flecks of light skate ahead, dancing to the tune as
    if eager for you to follow.
  - "The song wavers, splitting and rejoining, echoing off walls that can\u2019t
    decide if they want to cradle you or swallow you whole."
  - You rise without thinking. Staying still feels worse than whatever waits in the
    depths.
  typeSpeed: 0.03
  segmentDelay: 1
  musicForThisCutscene: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c126ec652b84e3d4ca0a2bf6c51f3b86, type: 3}
  stopMusicOnFinish: 1
  nextSceneName: MainLevel
